0008A4r 1               ; grp[0..7] -> cells 1 + 3 pgrp .. + 2 of row prow, inks dg_c0..2 on black.
0008A4r 1               ; Each character (2 x 4 pixels, bit 2k = row k's left pixel, 2k+1 its
0008A4r 1               ; right) becomes 3 screen pixels across (left, left, right at an even
0008A4r 1               ; column; left, right, right at an odd one) by 8 lines.
